---
import AdminLayout from "../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro";
---
<AdminLayout
  title="Waitlist locale — Admin ManabuPlay"
  activeNav="waitlist"
  description="Lecture, export et purge de la collecte email locale du site public via bridge local."
  bodyClass="text-slate-200 waitlist-shell"
  containerClass="waitlist-wrap"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <style>
    .waitlist-shell { min-height:100vh; background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 45% at 50% -10%,rgba(139,92,246,.22) 0%,transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 90% 15%,rgba(34,211,238,.14) 0%,transparent 60%),
      #0a0911; }
    .waitlist-wrap { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 1.5rem)); margin:0 auto; padding:5.5rem 0 2rem; }
    .waitlist-card { background:rgba(15,12,26,.92); border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.18); border-radius:.5rem; box-shadow:0 .75rem 2rem rgba(0,0,0,.32); }
    .waitlist-hero { padding:1.25rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
    .waitlist-eyebrow { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; min-height:2rem; padding:0 .75rem; border-radius:.5rem; background:rgba(34,211,238,.12); border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.28); color:#22d3ee; font-size:.82rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .waitlist-eyebrow::before { content:""; width:.5rem; height:.5rem; border-radius:999rem; background:currentColor; }
    .waitlist-title { margin:.75rem 0 .5rem; font-family:'Joystix',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(1.35rem,3vw,2.35rem); color:#fff; line-height:1.15; }
    .waitlist-copy { max-width:76ch; color:#c7c2df; font:500 1.08rem/1.68 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .waitlist-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
    .waitlist-stat { padding:1rem; }
    .waitlist-stat-label { color:#8f8aa7; font:800 .82rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .waitlist-stat-value { margin-top:.6rem; color:#fff; font:800 2rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .waitlist-panel { padding:1rem; }
    .waitlist-toolbar { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:.75rem; margin-bottom:1rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .waitlist-panel-title { color:#fff; font:800 1.25rem/1.2 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .waitlist-actions { display:flex; gap:.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .waitlist-button { min-height:2.5rem; padding:0 .85rem; border-radius:.5rem; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); color:#fff; font:800 .88rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.04em; cursor:pointer; }
    .waitlist-button:hover { border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.35); background:rgba(34,211,238,.1); }
    .waitlist-button.danger:hover { border-color:rgba(248,113,113,.35); background:rgba(248,113,113,.1); }
    .waitlist-table-wrap { overflow:auto; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:.5rem; }
    .waitlist-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; min-width:46rem; }
    .waitlist-table th,
    .waitlist-table td { padding:.85rem .75rem; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07); text-align:left; font:700 .92rem/1.35 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .waitlist-table th { color:#8f8aa7; background:rgba(255,255,255,.035); letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .waitlist-table td { color:#d9d5ee; }
    .waitlist-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom:0; }
    .waitlist-email { color:#fff; }
    .waitlist-empty { display:none; padding:1.25rem; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:.5rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,.035); color:#a9a3c3; font:600 1rem/1.6 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .waitlist-note { margin-top:1rem; color:#8f8aa7; font:600 .95rem/1.55 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .waitlist-status { min-height:1.35rem; margin:.25rem 0 1rem; color:#22d3ee; font:800 .9rem/1.35 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.04em; opacity:0; transform:translateY(-.25rem); transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .18s ease; }
    .waitlist-status.is-visible { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
    .waitlist-panel.is-refreshing { animation:waitlist-refresh-pulse .42s ease; }
    @keyframes waitlist-refresh-pulse {
      0% { border-color:rgba(139,92,246,.18); box-shadow:0 .75rem 2rem rgba(0,0,0,.32); }
      45% { border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.45); box-shadow:0 .75rem 2.25rem rgba(34,211,238,.14); }
      100% { border-color:rgba(139,92,246,.18); box-shadow:0 .75rem 2rem rgba(0,0,0,.32); }
    }
    @media (max-width:860px) {
      .waitlist-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .waitlist-wrap { padding-top:4.25rem; }
    }
  </style>
  </Fragment>
    <section class="waitlist-card waitlist-hero">
      <span class="waitlist-eyebrow">0.1 waitlist</span>
      <h1 class="waitlist-title">Collecte email locale</h1>
      <p class="waitlist-copy">
        Cette page interroge le stockage du site public via un bridge local entre le dashboard et ManabuPlay.
        En production, le formulaire public reste câblé pour Netlify Forms et doit encore être vérifié sur un déploiement réel.
        En local, le dashboard vise l’app publique sur le même host en port <code>4321</code>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="waitlist-grid" aria-label="Résumé waitlist">
      <article class="waitlist-card waitlist-stat">
        <div class="waitlist-stat-label">Emails uniques</div>
        <div class="waitlist-stat-value" id="waitlist-count">0</div>
      </article>
      <article class="waitlist-card waitlist-stat">
        <div class="waitlist-stat-label">Langue FR</div>
        <div class="waitlist-stat-value" id="waitlist-fr-count">0</div>
      </article>
      <article class="waitlist-card waitlist-stat">
        <div class="waitlist-stat-label">Langue EN</div>
        <div class="waitlist-stat-value" id="waitlist-en-count">0</div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="waitlist-card waitlist-panel" id="waitlist-panel">
      <div class="waitlist-toolbar">
        <h2 class="waitlist-panel-title">Emails capturés en local</h2>
        <div class="waitlist-actions">
          <button class="waitlist-button" type="button" id="waitlist-refresh">Rafraîchir</button>
          <button class="waitlist-button" type="button" id="waitlist-export">Exporter CSV</button>
          <button class="waitlist-button danger" type="button" id="waitlist-clear">Effacer les emails locaux</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="waitlist-status" id="waitlist-status" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <div class="waitlist-empty" id="waitlist-empty">
        Aucun email local trouvé sur le site public. Va sur la landing, inscris un email, puis reviens ici.
      </div>

      <div class="waitlist-table-wrap" id="waitlist-table-wrap">
        <table class="waitlist-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Email</th>
              <th>Langue</th>
              <th>Date locale</th>
              <th>Source</th>
              <th>Page</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="waitlist-body"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="waitlist-note">
        Stockage lu côté site public : <code>mp_waitlist_submissions</code>. Cette sauvegarde locale valide le parcours,
        pas la délivrabilité réelle d’un email ni la réception Netlify.
      </p>
    </section>
  <script slot="scripts" type="module" is:inline src="/scripts/admin-waitlist.js"></script>
</AdminLayout>
